      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EZK",
          "chapter": 7,
          "verse": 6
        }
      ],
      "en": "An end has come. The end has come! It awakes against you. Behold, it comes.",
      "ko": "끝이 났도다, 끝이 났도다, 끝이 너를 치러 일어났나니 볼찌어다 임박하도다",
      "source_text_hash": "31a600d8ded323d7c7b294346fa5523cc177340c24648e1754dd7db8a774c5ed",
      "translation_text_hash": "ddaff97ca5602f5acc05fed47f6c4be9aee26b2f9471f0745a7ad2d0f9066996",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "끝이 났도다, 끝이 났도다, 끝이 너를 치러 일어났나니 볼찌어다 임박하도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "ddaff97ca5602f5acc05fed47f6c4be9aee26b2f9471f0745a7ad2d0f9066996"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:EZK:7:7",
      "sequence": 20585,
      "chapter_label": "EZK 7",
