      "en": "“‘The sword is outside, and the pestilence and the famine within. He who is in the field will die by the sword. He who is in the city will be devoured by famine and pestilence.",
      "ko": "밖에는 칼이 있고 안에는 온역과 기근이 있어서 밭에 있는 자는 칼에 죽을 것이요 성읍에 있는 자는 기근과 온역에 망할 것이며",
      "source_text_hash": "056424567d7cf892d2f61fd70c43dd7de3473f7e9d54b44e2abbec464df19d08",
      "translation_text_hash": "40c8dea04659574983766720e5c5151a0e61f519ab07a8a6208b95f279ef8ab1",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
