      "en": "All hands will be feeble, and all knees will be weak as water.",
      "ko": "모든 손은 피곤하고 모든 무릎은 물과 같이 약할 것이라",
      "source_text_hash": "6761ddd6a2c1f93050ac9768398fb5a6e852d9006e53e3a06da0c2dd3a30bf7f",
      "translation_text_hash": "6b4644648beba7a2085d9eea73025ddc51b00998f74b0f0c50b0c2a425444e35",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
