      "en": "I will give it into the hands of the strangers for a prey, and to the wicked of the earth for a plunder; and they will profane it.",
      "ko": "외인의 손에 붙여 노략하게 하며 세상 악인에게 붙여 그들로 약탈하여 더럽히게 하고",
      "source_text_hash": "98814915a7a772c1e1c39ba14c1474fd1c011cfda0bafde8c86a8d1c805df4cb",
      "translation_text_hash": "6fd31cfc1702b3873c75f46782c89c531dea32287fab78ca27485e101f97ab1c",
