      "en": "Destruction comes! They will seek peace, and there will be none.",
      "ko": "패망이 이르리니 그들이 평강을 구하여도 없을 것이라",
      "source_text_hash": "5c49438d5274114cdb3a857925f7c578037eb7b2c753743bd3d1c8f63466ff65",
      "translation_text_hash": "12605263011c8e6d65d248db6ce093c234a04335aeaf634c2294899eab5d9fba",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
